00:21:19.711 --> 00:21:24.716 align:start size:84% position:16%
So it can be extremely
cathartic, it's
really cleansing.

00:21:25.817 --> 00:21:28.654 align:start size:88% position:13%
But you're always gonna
feel better after.

00:21:28.654 --> 00:21:33.659 align:start position:0%
And I actually had, very
colloquially, we say bad trips,

00:21:34.793 --> 00:21:36.361 align:start size:88% position:13%
but I like the word
more challenging trips.

00:21:36.361 --> 00:21:38.830
But they were actually the
nicest or the best ones.

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:40.465
Not the nice ones
but the best ones,

00:21:40.465 --> 00:21:42.200
because they gave me so much.

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:45.270 align:start size:97% position:3%
Because I learned so much
about, again, fears, whatever,

00:21:45.270 --> 00:21:48.573
which we should try
to hide somewhere.

00:21:48.573 --> 00:21:49.541
And you dissolve them.

00:21:49.541 --> 00:21:50.976
Anyway, so that's one thing.

00:21:50.976 --> 00:21:53.812 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the second big
thing, what also happens,

00:21:53.812 --> 00:21:58.784
is you feel connected to
nature and other humans

00:22:01.953 --> 00:22:03.388
in a way you can't describe.

00:22:03.388 --> 00:22:04.856
And one other form,

00:22:04.856 --> 00:22:09.328 align:start size:97% position:3%
so there are several sources
of mental health issues,

00:22:10.195 --> 00:22:11.430
if I'm being oversimplified.

00:22:11.430 --> 00:22:14.766 align:start size:84% position:16%
The one I already said
is fear and trauma.

00:22:14.766 --> 00:22:16.868 align:start size:84% position:16%
And the other one
is lost connections.

00:22:16.868 --> 00:22:21.106 align:start size:97% position:3%
A lot of people feel
disconnected from everything.

00:22:21.106 --> 00:22:23.709 align:start size:84% position:16%
From the world, from
people, whatever.

00:22:23.709 --> 00:22:28.714
And psychedelics bring back
their enormous sort of love

00:22:30.115 --> 00:22:33.251 align:start size:97% position:3%
for the creation, for what
it's like for humans, animals.

00:22:33.251 --> 00:22:34.653
This is why by the way,

00:22:34.653 --> 00:22:37.089 align:start size:97% position:3%
this is why a lot of
people go vegan after that,

00:22:37.089 --> 00:22:38.557
or at least say,

00:22:38.557 --> 00:22:40.926 align:start size:97% position:3%
