towards my environment."

00:22:40.926 --> 00:22:43.428
And then the third part
is very interesting.

00:22:43.428 --> 00:22:46.098
And that is maybe, and all
of these things are very,

00:22:46.098 --> 00:22:48.133
I think, helping in what I said

00:22:48.133 --> 00:22:51.069
to detraumatize the world.

00:22:52.804 --> 00:22:55.507
The third one is
in the weeks after,

00:22:55.507 --> 00:22:56.842
