growing a bit.

00:22:58.510 --> 00:23:00.245
We call that neuroplasticity.

00:23:01.947 --> 00:23:06.952
So which helps you on the
one side to develop habits

00:23:07.686 --> 00:23:09.154
or to get rid of habits.

00:23:09.154 --> 00:23:11.590
So it's extremely helpful if
you wanna get off an addiction,

00:23:11.590 --> 00:23:12.791
stuff like that.

00:23:12.791 --> 00:23:15.694 align:start size:84% position:16%
But also if you look
at brains after,

00:23:15.694 --> 00:23:20.098
